Food Safety Inspection | Wacky Wok Cloud Kitchen 
 CMC Food Safety Officers conducted an inspection at Wacky Wok Cloud Kitchen, Satya Towers, Kondapur, to review food safety and hygiene practices. 
 Good practices observed: 
 • Hairnets used by food handlers 
 • No expired raw materials found 
 • FIFO and FEFO practices followed 
 • Fly catchers installed 
 • Veg and non-veg food areas separated 
 Major violations observed: 
 • Inadequate cooling in the freezer, with spoiled vegetables and pest activity observed 
 • No hot-water sanitation of utensils 
 • Freezer found poorly maintained and unhygienic 
 • Synthetic colours found in use and discarded on the spot 
 FoSCoS Score: 60/98 (61%) 
 The establishment was advised to rectify the deficiencies and maintain required food safety and hygiene standards. 
 #TeamCMC #FoodSafety #SafeFood #Cyberabad 
