Food Safety Inspection | Varnam, Hafeezpet 
 CMC Food Safety Officers conducted an inspection at Varnam, Genpact Lane, Hafeezpet to review food hygiene and safety practices. 
 Good practice observed: 
 • Good personal hygiene maintained by food handlers. 
 Non-compliances observed: 
 • Water stagnation and food waste in drains 
 • Iron knives and no pallets in use 
 • Required medical, food testing, water testing and packaging records not available 
 • Refrigerator not properly cleaned/sorted, with water leakage observed 
