Food Safety Inspection | Wow! Momo 
 Yesterday, Food Safety Officers of CMC conducted an inspection at Wow! Momo Foods Pvt. Ltd., GSM Mall, Madinaguda, to assess compliance with food safety and hygiene standards. 
 Good practices observed: 
 • Food handlers maintained personal hygiene. 
 • FSSAI licence displayed prominently at the premises. 
 Major observations: 
 • Cockroach infestation observed in the premises. 
 • Water testing, food testing, packaging testing and medical fitness records were not available. 
 • No hot water provision in the dishwashing area. 
 • Expired sauces and paneer were identified and discarded during the inspection. 
 • Spoiled vegetables and leafy vegetables were discarded. 
 • Onion storage crates required proper cleaning. 
 • Deep cleaning of the flooring was found to be inadequate. 
 FoSCoS Score: 78/116 (68%) 
 An Improvement Notice is being issued, directing the Food Business Operator to rectify the deficiencies and ensure compliance with food safety standards. 
 #TeamCMC #FoodSafety #SafeFood #Cyberabad 
