Food Safety Inspection | Barbeque Nation 
 Food Safety Officers of CMC conducted an inspection at Barbeque Nation, GSM Mall, Madinaguda, to assess compliance with food safety and hygiene standards. 
 Good practices observed: 
 • Food safety records, including medical fitness certificates, pest control, food testing, water testing and packaging records, were properly maintained. 
 • FSSAI licence displayed prominently at the premises. 
 • No pest activity observed during the inspection. 
 • Probe thermometer used to monitor the internal temperature of cooked food. 
 Areas requiring improvement: 
