Food Safety Inspection | BigBasket Warehouse 
 A routine Food Safety Inspection was conducted at BigBasket Warehouse (Innovative Retail Concepts Pvt. Ltd.), Jaya Bheri, Kompally, 
 to assess compliance with food safety and hygiene standards. 
 Good Practices Observed: 
 • FSSAI licence displayed at the premises 
 • Pest control records maintained 
 • FIFO (First In, First Out) system followed 
 Areas Requiring Improvement: 
 • Food handlers were not wearing gloves and hair nets 
 • Non-food articles were stored alongside food items at certain locations 
 • Medical fitness records of food handlers were not available 
 • Onion and ginger-garlic storage area was found untidy 
 Action Taken: 
 An Improvement Notice has been issued, directing the establishment to rectify the deficiencies and strengthen food safety practices. 
 Hygiene Assessment: 68/74 (92%) 
