Food Safety Inspection Drive 
 Establishment: Fire Water Neo Bar & Kitchen 
 Financial District, Nanakramguda 
 09.07.2026 
 As part of routine food safety inspections across Cyberabad, CMC Food Safety teams inspected Fire Water Neo Bar & Kitchen. 
 Good Practice 
 • No visible pest infestation observed and pest control records were available. 
 Key Observations 
 • Several prepared food items were assigned a shelf life of 2–5 days without any technical or laboratory evidence to support it 
 • Raw crabs, boneless chicken legs, prawns, chicken wings, baby corn packs and other food items were found without labels and discarded on the spot 
 • One pack of expired mushrooms found during inspection 
