 • Vegetarian and non-vegetarian food items stored together in the chiller 
 • Food commodity names not mentioned on stored food items 
 • Eggs found without proper cleaning before storage 
 Action Taken 
 • Unlabelled food items and expired mushrooms were discarded on the spot. 
 • Improvement Notice will be issued, and the Food Business Operator (FBO) has been instructed to immediately rectify all identified deficiencies. 
